<title>JAPAN: Daiwa  Sec expects profit rise in 97/98.</title>
<headline>Daiwa  Sec expects profit rise in 97/98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Securities Co Ltd, one of Japan's &quot;Big Four&quot; brokerage houses, said on Friday it expects its earnings for the 1997/98 business year to improve from the previous year.</p>
<p>Daiwa officials also told a news conference that the company did not believe it had conducted any questionable deals.</p>
</text>
